    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 H13 placeholder deep-dive">This probe replaces a Placeholder verifier that currently returns InfraFault UNCONDITIONALLY for every subject -- the fix is a REAL check, not a different flavor of always-pass. A live Graph appRoleAssignments query compared against GraphAppRoles.cs's catalog, with EXPLICIT differentiated handling for the 11-completed-vs-3-null-GUID split so the probe's outcome is honest about what it can and cannot verify today.</constraint>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 pipelining note">H13 probes are buildable pipelined alongside their subject handler's wave, not serialized to the end -- this task can be authored as soon as its subject handler (cited in &lt;deps&gt;) lands, even though it is NUMBERED in the G-7 acceptance range for readability.</constraint>
    <constraint source="this project's risk register (plan.md §8)">The 3 still-null GraphAppRoles.cs GUIDs are a SEPARATE, pre-existing tracked risk item -- this probe MUST distinguish 'grant missing because the catalog entry is null' from 'grant missing despite a completed catalog entry' in its outcome classification, and MUST NOT silently treat the former as if the whole probe passed.</constraint>
  </constraints>

